==Nahuatl==

===Noun===
'''cuitlatl'''
excrement, residue; abscess, tumor, grown

example: teocuitlatl is the Nahuatl term for gold and literally means god excrement. Yacacuitlatl refers to boogers and is literally nose excrement. Cuitlatl usually refers to any type of excrement. 

